### 🔴 PATTERN 1: `dev_goose_expert_check.py` Called With Empty Args (False Positive)

| Field | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| **Finding ID** | F-DEV-GOOSE-CHECK (R55) |
| **Sub-Agent** | `pre-push-validator` |
| **Root Cause** | Check 8 calls `dev_goose_expert_check.py --check-mechanism "$(git diff ...)"`. When `git diff` is empty (no staged changes), script receives empty string → displays usage error → logged as false positive |
| **Impact** | False alarm in every pre-push run with no staged changes |
| **Fix** | Conditional call: only invoke if `$DIFF_CONTENT` is non-empty |

---

### 🟡 PATTERN 2: Missing `try/except` Error Handling (177 instances, K1)

| Field | Detail |
|-------|--------|
